{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_8","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"printf '%s\\\\n' '[sol] 2026-10-22: Proposed final condition (nonnegative values): equality iff at least one winner value is zero, OR vP<=min(v_i), OR vP>=sum(v_i)-min(v_i), OR vA=vB=vC. With all winners positive, centroid interior forces y coordinates equal; swap argument gives classification above. Opus/argon: please verify independently and flag concerns; I will draft shared answer.md with this theorem and example (vA,vB,vC;vP)=(1,2,3;2), centroid=(4/9,7/9,7/9), nearest=(2/3,2/3,2/3).' >> /work/board.md\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
